    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Genesis, placing tiles with unique properties contributes to the stability of your planet. The challenge is keeping up with the increasingly volatile core, until it has finished assembling. The player must use tiles, moons, and other fun features to uncover powerful combinations and keep maintain your stability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391560/extras/f94258b66ad98e4a64be82b09b73e9c8.avif?t=1740829709\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tile has its own unique effect and properties, which can be used to create combos and chains of interactions.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391560/extras/41c533c63c91e8d7746817e20f0d24db.avif?t=1740829709\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful evocations to alter the state of your planet, your cards, anything! for a price...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391560/extras/30157d393e87269881cfbcf5f59dd5ec.avif?t=1740829709\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the deck forge to improve your cards, remove junk, and modify triggers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391560/extras/83ebc26c4073fa00ef64919661296230.avif?t=1740829709\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and utilize the power of moons, and use their interactions to create stronger, more intricate combinations with your build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391560/extras/01cc0768d2978035aa0bb36079f5e8dc.avif?t=1740829709\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges will be thrown at you, junk tiles will fill your plates, and deck. Use your skills to overcome the obstacles and make the best of what you've been given. Even bad things can be used to your advantage if you're clever!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391560/extras/20074075a0fb73e4ac99b8e86a4b9f8e.avif?t=1740829709\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain your core until the last plate is put in place to become a successful creator! However, there will be so many more challenges to come...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Genesis, placing tiles with unique properties contributes to the stability of your planet. The challenge is keeping up with the increasingly volatile core, until it has finished assembling. The player must use tiles, moons, and other fun features to uncover powerful combinations and keep maintain your stability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391560/extras/f94258b66ad98e4a64be82b09b73e9c8.avif?t=1740829709\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tile has its own unique effect and properties, which can be used to create combos and chains of interactions.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391560/extras/41c533c63c91e8d7746817e20f0d24db.avif?t=1740829709\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful evocations to alter the state of your planet, your cards, anything! for a price...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391560/extras/30157d393e87269881cfbcf5f59dd5ec.avif?t=1740829709\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the deck forge to improve your cards, remove junk, and modify triggers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391560/extras/83ebc26c4073fa00ef64919661296230.avif?t=1740829709\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and utilize the power of moons, and use their interactions to create stronger, more intricate combinations with your build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391560/extras/01cc0768d2978035aa0bb36079f5e8dc.avif?t=1740829709\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges will be thrown at you, junk tiles will fill your plates, and deck. Use your skills to overcome the obstacles and make the best of what you've been given. Even bad things can be used to your advantage if you're clever!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391560/extras/20074075a0fb73e4ac99b8e86a4b9f8e.avif?t=1740829709\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain your core until the last plate is put in place to become a successful creator! However, there will be so many more challenges to come...</p>",
